      "content": "MissingInstrument also represents malformed symbols, not just empty ones: assessPlan() requires /^[A-Z][A-Z0-9.]{0,9}$/ after normalization. Changing a rejected symbol to another nonempty invalid value (for example, '!!!') currently clears the field error and summary line. Apply the domain symbol validation before marking this issue corrected.",
