      "content": "Local-time validation also returns `NonexistentLocalTime` and `AmbiguousLocalTime` for DST transitions. Those issues are produced by the same client-side submit check, but this condition never clears them after the trader selects a valid time. Allow all three local-time error codes to clear when conversion succeeds, while retaining server-only time issues until resubmission.",
