      "content": "The domain compares prices using exact `Rational` values, but these Stop/Target checks convert them to floating-point numbers. Distinct valid six-place decimals can round to the same number (for example, `10000000000.000001` and `10000000000.000002`), leaving a corrected risk/target issue visible until resubmission. Parse and compare with the domain decimal utilities for both checks so clearing matches server validation.",
